{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj46BrbzDrVE8ZPyP5gW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a weathered oak door, ancient and immovable.*\n\n*The iron keyhole glows faintly.*\n\nYou hold out a key.\n\n**Which key?**\n\n*I have waited centuries. I do not open for just any key. Name it. Shape it. Tell me what it's made of, what it unlocks, and why you carry it.*\n\n*The tumblers wait.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":95,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}